# Secrets for the docs-rag Edge Function. Copy to `supabase/functions/.env` (git-ignored)
# for local development; `supabase functions serve` loads that file automatically.
#
# This is the Edge Function's OWN delivery path — separate from migrations. `supabase db
# push` never carries it, and secrets here are NOT set with `supabase secrets set` locally.
# Pushing this function or its secrets to the hosted project is the maintainer's manual
# decision, made after review; it is not part of normal local work.

# One PRODUCT-WIDE Voyage key. Not per-workspace, not per-user, and never in the browser or
# on a developer machine — it lives only in this function's secrets. Add a payment method to
# the Voyage account first: without one the account sits at 3 RPM / 10K TPM, unusable on both
# the indexing and the query path. The card buys throughput (Usage Tier 1), not tokens — the
# 200M free tokens still apply.
#
# When this is unset, search still works: it degrades to full-text and reports status
# "fulltext". Indexing, which must embed, fails with "voyage_unavailable" until a key is set.
VOYAGE_API_KEY=
